  sentences:
    nameNPC: "T\xF4i"
    Lines:
    - "Tr\u1EADn \"\u0111\xE1nh\" n\u1ED5 ra. \u0110\xE1m tr\u1EBB c\u1EE7a \u0110inh
      Ho\xE0n r\u0103m r\u1EAFp tu\xE2n l\u1EC7nh, ph\u1ED1i h\u1EE3p nh\u1ECBp nh\xE0ng.
      Ch\xEDnh \u0110inh Ho\xE0n lao l\xEAn ph\xEDa tr\u01B0\u1EDBc, d\xF9ng c\xE0nh
      lau c\u1EE7a m\xECnh g\u1EA1t ph\u0103ng \"v\u0169 kh\xED\" c\u1EE7a \u0110inh
      \u0110i\u1EC1n trong m\u1ED9t chi\xEAu g\u1ECDn gh\u1EBD, r\u1ED3i ch\u1EC9a
      th\u1EB3ng v\xE0o ng\u1EF1c \u0111\u1ED1i th\u1EE7."
